<title>USA: Sioux City cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderate. Compared with Monday, slaughter steers and heifers traded steady on a thin test. Many cattle carrying 1-2 percent mud.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3, 1200-1350 lbs 64.00-65.10.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3, 1100-1150 lbs 65.25. Select 62.00.</p>
</text>
